 step N, a privileged LDR of an AP=0 section succeeds and warms the page, MSR CPSR_c,#0x10, the same LDR in USR32 is SERVED (no abort); cold, the USR load takes the permission fault (FSR 0x0d).  cpu_arm_instr_loadstore.c&#x27;s fast path indexes host_load/host_store by virtual page alone and consults is_userpage only for LDRT/STRT; nothing invalidates on a mode change.  Red on HEAD, so not a vehicle row; its own round, armmmuvehicle as the vehicle, S8 as the witness shape.</span></span><span class="state st-open">open</span></span></th></tr><tr class="ph st-open"><th scope="row" class="phlabel">Assessment (initial problem)</th><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td></tr><tr class="ph st-open"><th scope="row" class="phlabel">Research (fix proposals)</th><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td></tr><tr class="ph st-open"><th scope="row" class="phlabel">Final review (flagship adjudication)</th><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td></tr><tr class="ph st-open"><th scope="row" class="phlabel">Regression testing</th><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td></tr><tr class="fixhead st-open"><th colspan="10"><span class="hline"><span class="wrap" tabindex="0"><span class="rid">armthumbabtlr</span><span class="ttl">cpu_arm.c arm_exception(): Thumb-state aborts save the wrong return address -- data abort LR_abt = instruction + 7, prefetch abort target + 3 (DDI 0100I: + 8 and + 4 in both states)</span><span class="tip">cpu_arm.c arm_exception(): Thumb-state aborts save the wrong return address -- data abort LR_abt = instruction + 7, prefetch abort target + 3 (DDI 0100I: + 8 and + 4 in both states) — note: filed 2026-10-09: retaddr = cpu-&gt;pc (+ 4 for a data abort) + (T ? 2 : 4), and in Thumb state cpu-&gt;pc carries bit 0.  MEASURED by Fable 5.1 on the armmmuvehicle pass-1 sessions S10 (Thumb LDR to an unmapped VA: LR_abt = 0x00008107 for an instruction at 0x8100) and S11 (Thumb BX to 0x100001: LR_abt = 0x00100003); read the same day by grok&#x27;s adversarial job.  DDI 0100I A2.6.6 / A2.6.5 (ddi0100i.txt:2236, :2196) give + 8 and + 4 in both states; IRQ/FIQ are also + 4 in both (:2386, :2440), so the T ? 2 : 4 term is right only for SWI/UND.  A sibling of armthumbabortkill; reachable only with the MMU on, so after armmmuvehicle.</span></span><span class="state st-open">open</span></span></th></tr><tr class="ph st-open"><th scope="row" class="phlabel">Assessment (initial problem)</th><td class="c n