 t_nopanel exempt, t_held queued; DASH annotation / nopanel / notseat renders tok.  Measured with HEAD&#x27;s tools: X_is_held_exact 32/49, X_never_discharge 43/49 (it reds t_discharged, one of the four rows heldmasked&#x27;s closure names), X_notseat_is_answer 45/49, X_annotation_is_answer 45/49, X_nopanel_not_exempt 41/49, X_dash_tok_blank 44/49.  The thirteenth is MISLABELLED: its regex anchors on leading whitespace before t_reread, which every listing line except a VIOLATION replaces with ok/--/.., so it can only assert &#x27;t_reread is not a violation&#x27;; X_filing_is_zero (`if len(got) == 1:` -&gt; `== 0`) passes 49/49.  Shape to adopt, one commit: the seven variants, and re-pin t_reread on its `..    t_reread  review  1/9  filed` line (or rename it).</span></span><span class="state st-open">open</span></span></th></tr><tr class="ph st-open"><th scope="row" class="phlabel">Assessment (initial problem)</th><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td></tr><tr class="ph st-open"><th scope="row" class="phlabel">Research (fix proposals)</th><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td></tr><tr class="ph st-open"><th scope="row" class="phlabel">Final review (flagship adjudication)</th><td class="c none"