  "_WHY": "The ledger's schema had NO WRITTEN SEMANTICS. That single absence is the cause behind six mis-counts in one session, two file-reading seats reading OPPOSITE conventions into one closure string, and five seats agreeing on only 4 of 11 rows they were asked to state-check. A field every round ranks and closes from was never defined.",
